WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.484 --> 00:00:01.242
PETER QUILL
I'm excited for you that you

00:00:01.293 --> 00:00:02.054
get to see this again.

00:00:02.105 --> 00:00:03.381
(Crank up the volume.)

00:00:03.433 --> 00:00:04.433
DRAX
[Laughing]

00:00:04.484 --> 00:00:06.492
(For the biggest event of the summer.)

00:00:06.698 --> 00:00:07.488
PETER QUILL
Oh come on.

00:00:07.539 --> 00:00:08.484
ROCKET
[Laughing]

00:00:08.535 --> 00:00:09.321
(Guardians is...)

00:00:10.289 --> 00:00:11.859
DRAX
Exactly, you idiots.

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:12.890
MANTIS
Oh no.

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.334
(...of the Guardians trilogy.)

00:00:15.386 --> 00:00:16.804
LILA
It's good to have friends.

00:00:16.906 --> 00:00:17.265
[Whistle]

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:23.007
ROCKET
So that happened.

00:00:23.078 --> 00:00:25.203
[Laughing]

